{"seq":2,"slug":"proxy-metrics","title":"代理指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-drift-model-monitoring/performance/proxy-metrics","wordCount":2047,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"代理指标\">代理指标</h1><p><a href=\"performance-degradation\">性能退化监控</a> 描绘的理想世界里，标签准时回来，你按时算准确率。现实是：信贷模型要等几个月才知道这笔贷款会不会违约，营销模型可能永远拿不到「如果不发券用户会不会买」的反事实标签。在标签到来之前的漫长空窗期里，模型可能已经在悄悄退化——但传统性能监控因为没有真值而完全失明。代理指标（proxy metrics）就是为填补这段空窗而生：在没有真实标签的情况下，估计模型性能掉了没掉。这是 2026 年 NannyML 等工具的核心卖点，也是无标签监控这一研究方向的主战场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>代理指标（proxy metrics）</strong>：在真实标签到来前的空窗期，用此刻可得的信号（预测、置信度、输入分布）反推模型性能掉了没掉。</li>\n<li><strong>置信度类代理</strong>：直接利用已输出的置信度（平均置信度、预测熵、不确定区占比、预测分布偏移），零成本可实时，但强依赖模型校准，适合粗筛。</li>\n<li><strong>CBPE（基于置信度的性能估计）</strong>：面向分类，用良好校准的预测概率重构期望混淆矩阵（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>TP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widehat{\\text{TP}}=\\sum_{\\hat y_i=1}p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9233em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9233em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TP</span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.6833em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.24em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"0.24em\" viewBox=\"0 0 1062 239\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22\nc-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），进而估出任意指标，不碰真实标签。</li>\n<li><strong>DLE（直接损失估计）</strong>：面向回归，用辅助模型（nanny model）学习「给定输入与主模型预测，主模型误差有多大」，直接估 RMSE/MAE。</li>\n<li><strong>根本限制</strong>：所有无标签估计都假设只有协变量漂移，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y\\mid X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不变；纯概念漂移下会给出过于乐观的假象。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要无标签的性能估计\">为什么需要无标签的性能估计</h2><p>把问题摆清楚：漂移检测能告诉你「输入变了」，但变了不等于性能掉了；性能监控能告诉你「性能掉了」，但要等标签。中间有一大片灰色地带——输入已经漂了、标签还没回来、你急切想知道「模型现在到底还行不行」。代理指标填的就是这片地带。它的雄心是：用此刻就能拿到的东西（模型的预测、置信度、输入分布），反推出此刻还拿不到的东西（真实性能）。</p>\n<p>需要先承认一个根本限制：无标签性能估计在纯概念漂移下会失败。所有这些方法的底层假设都是「模型学到的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y\\mid X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 关系仍然成立，只是输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 漂了」（即只有协变量漂移）。一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y\\mid X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 本身被改写（<a href=\"../foundations/drift-types\">漂移类型</a> 里的概念漂移），模型对自己的置信度判断也一起失效，代理估计会给出过于乐观的假象。所以代理指标是性能监控的「提前预警」，不是「最终替代」——真标签回来后仍要校验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"置信度类代理-免费但粗糙\">置信度类代理：免费但粗糙</h2><p>最省事的一类代理直接利用模型已经输出的预测置信度，不需要任何额外训练。常见信号有：平均预测置信度（softmax 最大值的均值）下降、预测熵升高、预测类别分布偏移、落入「不确定区间」（如二分类概率 0.4–0.6）的样本比例上升。直觉是：当输入漂移到模型不熟悉的区域，模型往往会变得更犹豫，置信度塌陷常先于性能塌陷出现。</p>\n<p>这类代理的优点是零成本、可实时算；缺点是它强依赖模型校准得好。一个过度自信（poorly calibrated）的神经网络可能在完全错误的预测上依然给出 0.99 的置信度，这时置信度信号会骗你。下表把几种置信度代理摆开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代理信号</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>前提假设</th>\n<th>主要失效场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平均置信度下降</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>模型校准良好</td>\n<td>过度自信模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测熵上升</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定区样本占比</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>决策边界附近敏感</td>\n<td>漂移远离边界时漏报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测分布偏移</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>间接反映标签漂移</td>\n<td>协变量漂移混淆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>因为粗糙，置信度代理适合做高频粗筛，不适合当精确的性能数字。要更准，得用下面的专门方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cbpe-与-dle-把性能算出来\">CBPE 与 DLE：把性能算出来</h2><p>NannyML 推广的两个方法把无标签性能估计做成了可落地的工程。第一个是 CBPE（Confidence-Based Performance Estimation，基于置信度的性能估计），用于分类。它的核心洞察是：如果模型的预测概率是良好校准的，那么这些概率本身就编码了「每个预测有多大可能正确」的信息，可以据此重构混淆矩阵的期望值，进而估出准确率、F1、AUC 等任意指标——全程不碰真实标签。简化地说，对一批样本，期望真阳性可写成把预测为正且校准概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的样本的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 加总：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>TP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>FP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widehat{\\text{TP}} = \\sum_{i:\\,\\hat{y}_i=1} p_i, \\qquad \\widehat{\\text{FP}} = \\sum_{i:\\,\\hat{y}_i=1} (1 - p_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9233em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9233em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TP</span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.6833em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.24em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"0.24em\" viewBox=\"0 0 1062 239\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22\nc-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9233em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FP</span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.6833em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.24em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"0.24em\" viewBox=\"0 0 1062 239\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22\nc-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord accent mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由期望混淆矩阵即可推出任何基于它的指标。CBPE 的命门因此是校准——上线后通常要先在一段有标签的参考期把模型概率重新校准（如保序回归、Platt 缩放），再用于估计。</p>\n<p>第二个是 DLE（Direct Loss Estimation，直接损失估计），用于回归。回归没有「置信度」可用，DLE 改训练一个辅助模型（nanny model），专门学习「在给定输入和主模型预测下，主模型的误差有多大」，从而直接估计 RMSE、MAE 等损失。下图给出两者在监控里的位置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[线上预测产生&lt;br/&gt;标签尚未回来] --&gt; B{任务类型?}&#10;  B --&gt;|分类| C[CBPE&lt;br/&gt;用校准概率重构混淆矩阵]&#10;  B --&gt;|回归| D[DLE&lt;br/&gt;辅助模型估计误差]&#10;  C --&gt; E[估计性能曲线]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{估计性能下降?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[提前预警&lt;br/&gt;先行排查/准备重训]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[继续观察]&#10;  G --&gt; I[真标签回来后校验估计]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[修正方法/重标定基线]\">flowchart TD\n  A[线上预测产生&lt;br/&gt;标签尚未回来] --&gt; B{任务类型?}\n  B --&gt;|分类| C[CBPE&lt;br/&gt;用校准概率重构混淆矩阵]\n  B --&gt;|回归| D[DLE&lt;br/&gt;辅助模型估计误差]\n  C --&gt; E[估计性能曲线]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{估计性能下降?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[提前预警&lt;br/&gt;先行排查/准备重训]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[继续观察]\n  G --&gt; I[真标签回来后校验估计]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[修正方法/重标定基线]</pre><p>注意整张图最后强制回到「真标签校验」这一步：代理估计是预支的判断，必须用迟到的真值不断回校，否则会在概念漂移下集体翻车。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用对代理指标-场景与边界\">用对代理指标：场景与边界</h2><p>什么时候值得上代理指标？标签延迟越长、漂移越频繁、误判代价越高，代理的价值越大——信贷、风控、保险这类「标签以月计」的场景是典型受益者；而标签几乎实时回来的场景（如点击预测，几分钟内就知道用户点没点）直接用真实性能更准，代理纯属多余。</p>\n<p>也要清醒它的三条边界。其一，概念漂移下失效，前面已反复强调。其二，依赖一段有标签的参考期来校准/训练辅助模型，纯冷启动用不了。其三，它估的是「期望性能」，对小批量数据方差大，需要足够的窗口样本量。把代理估计、置信度粗筛、和迟到的真实性能三者叠在一张图上对照，是实践中最稳的姿势——它们会在 <a href=\"../practice/alerting-thresholds\">告警与阈值</a> 里被综合成告警，并在 <a href=\"../practice/retraining-triggers\">重训触发</a> 里成为「等不及真标签就先动手」的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代理指标在标签到来前估计模型性能，填补漂移检测（输入变了）与性能监控（需等标签）之间的空窗。</li>\n<li>所有无标签估计都假设只有协变量漂移、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y\\mid X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 不变；纯概念漂移下会给出过于乐观的假象，必须事后用真标签校验。</li>\n<li>置信度类代理（平均置信度、熵、不确定区占比）零成本可实时，但强依赖模型校准，适合粗筛不适合当精确数字。</li>\n<li>CBPE 用良好校准的预测概率重构期望混淆矩阵估分类性能；DLE 训练辅助模型直接估回归损失，两者都需先有标签参考期。</li>\n<li>标签延迟越长、漂移越频、误判越贵，代理价值越大；标签近实时的场景直接用真性能。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>标签可得时的正路监控：<a href=\"performance-degradation\">性能退化监控</a></li>\n<li>标签为何迟到、迟到期怎么办：<a href=\"label-delay\">标签延迟问题</a></li>\n<li>代理失效的根因——概念漂移：<a href=\"../foundations/drift-types\">漂移类型 (协变量/标签/概念)</a></li>\n<li>跨库：无标签下量化预测不确定性的另一套框架见 <a href=\"../../conformal-prediction-uncertainty/\">共形预测与不确定性</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代理指标","id":"代理指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要无标签的性能估计","id":"为什么需要无标签的性能估计"},{"level":2,"text":"置信度类代理：免费但粗糙","id":"置信度类代理-免费但粗糙"},{"level":2,"text":"CBPE 与 DLE：把性能算出来","id":"cbpe-与-dle-把性能算出来"},{"level":2,"text":"用对代理指标：场景与边界","id":"用对代理指标-场景与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"性能退化监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-drift-model-monitoring/performance/performance-degradation"},"next":{"title":"标签延迟问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-drift-model-monitoring/performance/label-delay"}}